 */// AppGrabbed: HWND = hwnd of app thumbnail, objectID = 0, childID = 0// OverTarget: HWND = hwnd of app thumbnail, objectID =//            1 for center//            2 for near snapped//            3 for far snapped//            4 for prune//            childID = 0// Dropped: HWND = hwnd of app thumbnail, objectID = <same as above>, childID = 0// Cancelled: HWND = hwnd of app thumbnail, objectID = 0, childID = 0/*
